      "mergedPostDetails": "1. Turn on `Show All Avatar Performance Details` in the SDK `Settings`.\n\n2. Click back to `Builder` tab.\n\n3. The header `1. Prepare Your Content` always auto-collapses.\n\nExpected Behavior:\n\nThe `1. Prepare Your Content` header should NEVER auto-collapse when `Show All Avatar Performance Details` are enabled.\n\nPlease fix this. I prefer to see all details of the Performance Ranks detected (even if they are Good or better) alongside the Avatar Details without having to manually expand the header each time.",
